---
// The conversion point of the site. A section, not a footnote.
---
<section class="author" aria-labelledby="author-label">
  <h2 class="label" id="author-label">Author</h2>
  <p class="name">Matthew Meyer</p>
  <p class="bio">Director of Hockey Operations at a four-sheet facility in Metro Detroit, and a regional scout covering Michigan 16U and 18U AAA and high school hockey. He writes on hockey operations, organizational structure, and how programs are actually built.</p>
  <a class="contact" href="mailto:matthew@warsportsgroup.com">Get in touch</a>
</section>

<style>
  .author {
    margin: 72px 0 0;
    padding: 34px 0 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--hair-strong);
  }
  .label {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 10px;
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: .22em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--faint);
    line-height: 1.75;
    margin: 0 0 18px;
  }
  .name {
    font-size: 22px;
    color: var(--text-strong);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -.012em;
    margin: 0 0 12px;
  }
  .bio {
    font-size: 16.5px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: var(--muted);
    margin: 0 0 16px;
  }
  .contact {
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 11.5px;
    letter-spacing: .14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent);
    text-decoration: none;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--accent-line);
    padding-bottom: 2px;
  }
</style>
